{"agent":"fx-review-state","data":{"by":"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813-Godzila","evidence":{"chunk_findings":[{"chunk":1,"detail":"The fix marks every preserved round as free, but never bounds how many times a preserved pass may be reused. Given `[review].max_rounds = 2`, one real full pass followed by repeated reviewer outages makes each subsequent delta attempt go through `_keep_reviewed_round` with `round_kept=True`; `_full_rounds`/`_delta_rounds` then ignore all of them. Since the kept record still carries the prior `\"passed\"` outcome, the gate continues to pass while `_rounds_used` stays at 1. That lets an arbitrary number of later diffs auto-pass with no new reviewer report, effectively bypassing the max-rounds limit outside the `ddflow review --force --reason` agent path. See [D-review-force-with-reason].","digest":"08826362ab372085","location":"ddflow/services/gates/measured.py:189","severity":"MEDIUM","title":"ddflow/services/gates/measured.py:189"}],"chunks_total":1,"coverage":"1/1 chunk(s) reviewed","delta_rounds":0,"diff_chars":2906,"diff_sha":"bcc97a15b054258bbc16bc142536481e1fe23c1b791730f924e1b5541d09e1e7","diff_source":"main..HEAD + tracked working-tree changes in [REDACTED:path]","diff_stat":{"deletions":0,"files":0,"insertions":0,"untracked":0},"elapsed_s":421.1,"family":"deepseek","findings":1,"max_chunk_chars":5000,"model":"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813-Godzila","output_digest":"fe6f5db210d2d85b","output_file":".ddflow/local/reviews/fix-B435bbddb18.critic.lan-deepseek-v4-pro.20261022T101019Z-0b5cb0d1.jsonl","reason":"","review_kind":"full","reviewed":[1],"reviewed_head":"e7707083b3d46c6cb63cc4c262d748d161267a49","reviewed_paths":{"ddflow/api/review.py":"100644 44fff332d55693bff98b3182dd140cdbb3db0ad1","ddflow/services/gates/measured.py":"100644 29a797fd84e267bace65d93d548a37b6d2eebd55","tests/test_review_kept_round_count.py":"100644 34321c72c235911c25ff98bf09dbbb0a4c353a3e"},"reviewer":"lan-deepseek-v4-pro","reviewer_digest":"dd08c1466c2b